            "review_title": "Review at Quan Lam - Lau Bo Nhung",
            "review_text": "Sandrs\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nI have visited this Beef Hotpot Restaurant with my family for twice and I love how friendly the owner is\nApr 2022\nI was attracted by the name called \"Beef dip Vinegar Broth\" and I came to try. It's very interesting from the sauce to the broth. The sauce called \"Vietnamese fermented anchovy sauce\"\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 25, 2022",
